{"job_id":"F-080b749bbf71396c6256","family_id":"F-080b749bbf71396c6256","title":"중앙선거관리위원회 위원 수당 등에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":24,"target_id":"81baa9f3f455bf58d82ac72dc1f8b1f9e2ffa2e363bd027c1c68b8516d649494","source_hash":"febd4b14bf05130195c819ed51effdb2128c4d89c418cd255e9566debf89ed79","text":"关于国家选举委员会成员津贴等的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":155,"target_id":"bfe1e18a9dd015208a45d293e584fac75ae08c3bf7436b3cfed57149c5727a81","source_hash":"13eefeedbbba0ada26c6e2fb1e309ce1c8205dfe7f5dca83c1bac25239b4cf52","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定根据《国家选举委员会法》（以下简称“本法”）第十二条支付给国家选举委员会主席和非常任委员的促进公平选举的费用和审查议程项目津贴，以及为执行本规则所必需的事项。<2024年2月6日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":155,"end":274,"target_id":"c03c173f784feabf277665e61454774457fd98818f463566b18b78f26bbd2f6e","source_hash":"9b203c1f75cbc450fd3e9a861577046dc3f26bab205a14b7d65345474057f4d9","text":"第二条（适用范围）除其他法律法规另有规定外，国家选举委员会成员的津贴种类、领取人、金额等事宜，均适用本规则。<2024年2月6日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":274,"end":341,"target_id":"d8e2b54f62a861ce5165fa0dd474edcfc9895aba5774ccff11cee07bf0e3e82e","source_hash":"f302997352a772ca8d192998bae9454e2f296e1a942b1813c4e2ca592aa37c05","text":"第三条（支付日期）本规则规定的津贴等款项，应于每月最后一天支付。<2023年1月20日、2024年2月6日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":341,"end":526,"target_id":"d851975fc9166cd796e731b6f013b0f0f7f7dcf2209089528cb384f5558784bf","source_hash":"a98b04b6a6949fbd96d5a7c541a0dc6e7c53bff366c95f7d27dead1a1b8dae1e","text":"第四条（公平选举宣传活动的费用）\n① 根据本法第十二条第一款第一项规定，促进公平选举的费用应当用于补偿国家选举委员会主席和非常任委员为收集数据、开展研究、进行公平选举宣传活动等而产生的费用。<2024年2月6日修订>\n② 公平选举宣传活动的受益人和支出金额详见附表。<2024年2月6日新增>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":526,"end":740,"target_id":"31b40a24ea3307b1c3d3fbb44bd84f5c3001f41e0ba4a59f6d8ab37a27dffac0","source_hash":"3dab9c7b5c4172bb78d1ddee9284502790840db7ae03c2591918b71ab5edd321","text":"第五条（议程审查的许可）\n① 根据本法第十二条第一款第二项规定，国家选举委员会主席和非常任委员应领取议程审查津贴，以支持其开展议程审查活动。<2024年2月6日修订>\n② 根据第1款规定，议程审查津贴按每项议程10万韩元的标准支付，适用于《国家选举委员会法实施细则》第11条第1款规定的会议议程中需要解决的事项，以及涉及重要政策和时事问题的报告事项。<2024年2月6日新增>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":740,"end":784,"target_id":"2a7659a2b4b51cb9a7c3cd6b6006c61b2a0680685d3b6713dbea3c1eda2bb884","source_hash":"05ddaff6e8704152a02e3c5353ec0370fa90b117266dc25cbc51a33e74148feb","text":"补充规定 <第398号，2013年12月30日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":784,"end":827,"target_id":"9aa02975060470c06af8b42273866feae1a325c35a03725ab0d987b024cff27a","source_hash":"a35fb835c070108e735f598d7c4fe7d133b3ed13895107a02b8803d11bebf272","text":"补充规定 <第525号，2021年1月28日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":827,"end":901,"target_id":"b58b649ed745138edc75199bdcec1746858b302a53cd2363d797772df2f85a16","source_hash":"d525da8068aa5f4c8fbb5441c56a4d9f48ec705855c9299ba3d0e519af9f5257","text":"补充规定 <第571号，2023年1月20日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效，但适用于 2023 年 1 月 1 日或之后支付的津贴。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"BODY","start":901,"end":1249,"target_id":"4390ff8ec40ae3d47c7e38d1ed6728d0cb5932ce8ff96481910fea66b0c60120","source_hash":"ee8b212291d7adc2a780622ad69cdaf2a0943fd389d5f298e60661e94b725836","text":"补充规定 <第598号，2024年2月6日>\n\n本规则自公布之日起生效，但自2024年1月30日起适用。\n\n公平选举促进活动费用支付标准表\n■ 国家选举委员会成员津贴等规定 [附表] <2024年2月6日新增>\n\n  公平选举促进活动费用支付标准表         \n\n  ┌────────┬───────┐  \n\n  │符合条件 │付款金额 │  \n\n  ├────────┼───────┤  \n\n  │董事长 │每月 2,900,000 韩元 │  \n\n  ├────────┼───────┤  \n\n  │非固定会员│每月2,150,000韩元│  \n\n  └────────┴───────┘"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00001","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762298","source_hash":"2ddcaaefdd8f368307f6aecbf291089b840c8e57c4c079c2fc3af55756604e19","text":"■ 国家选举委员会成员津贴等规定 [附表] <2024年2月6日新增>"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00002","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762299","source_hash":"47ad19ed3c206a19f7069e1ffdff025dd1338ea4269810c40d6a02d806c7fc9a","text":"公平选举促进活动费用支付标准表"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00003","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762300","source_hash":"c8d23be000dafeb6c621c34f772b3fe4367d64f2c37f08d67bbc4c2fc0f7270a","text":"付款符合条件"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00004","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762301","source_hash":"c02e23efa6cc2206b31cb2f35b6b85a43fe55683f6408b4ad52a85647a9f9348","text":"付款"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00005","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762302","source_hash":"f8b5edc7155d7c5fa8ce3e7933deaf3fda799d1ef3bd1848124b46d366060c01","text":"主席"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00006","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762303","source_hash":"51ccdcc8647543e49239c005674711fc2eba92aaa0205fe36bf9ad8d8c57a2ee","text":"月 2,900,000 韩元"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00007","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762304","source_hash":"bbc0771cecf891423e5bfb1414df56973033d2d432d898c6fd5c0a5f9d526e36","text":"非常任委员会成员"},{"id":"A37752-zh-00008","doc":"A37752","law_id":"kr-011968-260131-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2762305","source_hash":"9079e7963e5f0e770684ed97d27245703a133cf1759fe874b3a2f3ccf373e97e","text":"第 2,150,000 韩元"}]}